  "question": {
    "text": "A photograph of a landscape is captured by a drone camera at a height of 18 km . The size of the camera film is $2 \\mathrm{~cm} \\times 2 \\mathrm{~cm}$ and the area of the landscape photographed is $400 \\mathrm{~km}^2$. The focal length of the lens in the drone camera is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "vs3VD",
      "text": "1.8 cm",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "bDQ0U",
      "text": "0.9 cm",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1zFMY",
      "text": "2.8 cm",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "E5gYK",
      "text": "2.5 cm",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/-gzLE7eXJVgAuB8K3c4YFkxBBBSUa5EGNJgeRJTUJqo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n$\\mathrm{H}=18 \\mathrm{~km}$\n\nSize of camera film $=2 \\mathrm{~cm} \\times 2 \\mathrm{~cm}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& A_{\\text {image }}=400 \\mathrm{~km}^2 \\\\\n& x=20 \\times 10^3 \\mathrm{~m}=2 \\times 10^4 \\mathrm{~m} \\\\\n& y=2 \\times 10^{-2} \\mathrm{~m} \\\\\n& \\frac{x}{y}=10^6=\\frac{18 \\mathrm{Km}}{\\mathrm{f}} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{f}=18 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{~m}=18 \\mathrm{~mm} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{f}=1.8 \\mathrm{~cm}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
